{"track":"r","category":"벡터·문자열","level":2,"title":"문자열 반복","desc":"<p>문자열 <code>s</code>를 <code>n</code>번 이어 붙인 문자열을 돌려주는 <code>repeat_string(s, n)</code>을 만드세요. 예: <code>(\"ab\", 3)</code> → <code>\"ababab\"</code></p>","solution":"repeat_string <- function(s, n) {\n  strrep(s, n)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>strrep(문자열, 횟수)</code> 또는 <code>paste(rep(s, n), collapse = \"\")</code></p>","tests":[{"call":"repeat_string(\"ab\", 3)","expected":"ababab","visible":true},{"call":"repeat_string(\"x\", 0)","expected":"","visible":true},{"call":"repeat_string(\"\", 5)","expected":"","visible":false},{"call":"repeat_string(\"hi\", 1)","expected":"hi","visible":false}],"starter":"repeat_string <- function(s, n) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-326"}